# Porter line-ending policy.
#
# This project is developed and run on Linux (WSL) and built with the Go
# toolchain there, so the repository stores LF and the working tree uses LF.
# Without this, Windows git (core.autocrlf=true) normalises the index to LF
# while leaving CRLF on disk, which makes every file look modified to any
# git that runs with autocrlf unset.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never normalise.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ext4 binary
*.img binary
*.squashfs binary
*.tar binary
*.gz binary
*.tgz binary
*.zip binary
*.db binary
vmlinux binary
vmlinux-* binary
*.so binary
